{
  "about": "Halo's 'normal work' test set (L2). Draft 2026-10-21, awaiting approval. Each task passes when one of expect_tools succeeds, no avoid_tools is called, and (if given) the answer contains one of answer_any. approval: what the test harness answers when Halo asks (auto = approve, deny = decline). held_out_site: a website that must never appear in training data; these tasks measure how well the model handles sites it has not seen. Setup: tasks that need files use ~/HaloEval, created by the scoring script. Gmail, LinkedIn and GitHub tasks read the user's signed-in accounts: keep training-data recording off while the test runs, and never share its results.",
